## Color Palette

### Primary Colors

- **Brand Blue**: `#0f5384` (use `text-[#0f5384]` for icons and accents)
- **Gradient**: `bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-indigo-50` (for headers)

### Background Colors

- **Main content areas (dialogs/cards)**: `bg-slate-50` (ALWAYS use in dialog/popover/card content sections)
- **Nested content cards**: `bg-white` (for contrast against slate-50)
- **Footer sections**: `bg-slate-50`
- **Glass cards**: Use `.glass-card` class (no explicit background needed)

### Border Colors

- **Standard borders**: `border-slate-200` (cards, dialogs, dividers)
- **Form field borders**: `border-slate-300` (inputs, selects, textareas, search fields)
- **Hover borders**: `border-blue-300`

### Text Colors

- **Primary text**: `text-slate-700`
- **Secondary text**: `text-slate-600`
- **Muted text**: `text-slate-500`
- **Headers**: `sidebar-gradient-text` (brand colors)
- **Accents**: `text-[#0f5384]` (brand blue), `text-blue-600`, `text-green`, `text-purple-600`

