## ui-ux-pro-max pre-delivery checklist (CAALM mapping)

| Check | CAALM implementation |
|-------|---------------------|
| No emoji icons | Lucide (`lucide-react`) |
| cursor-pointer | `.interactive-glass-card`, `Button`, table row classes |
| Hover 150–300ms | `duration-200` on glass and `.primary-btn` |
| Light contrast | `text-slate-700` / `text-slate-600` on glass |
| Focus visible | `focus-visible:ring-*` on buttons, cards, table rows |
| Reduced motion | `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` in `globals.css` |
| Responsive | `375px, 768px, 1024px, 1440px` — standard container padding |
| Page container | `w-full px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-12` |

Reference: [`design-system/caalm/MASTER.md`](design-system/caalm/MASTER.md)

