## Consistency Checklist

When creating a new page or component, verify:

- [ ] Page uses standard container: `w-full px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-12`
- [ ] Page header uses: `h1 capitalize sidebar-gradient-text`
- [ ] All cards use: `glass-card` class with `glass-card-cap` div
- [ ] Stat cards do NOT use `CardHeader` (content directly in `CardContent`)
- [ ] Stat cards use: `p-4 sm:p-6` padding (NO `bg-slate-50`)
- [ ] Stat cards grid uses: `gap-6` (NOT `gap-4`)
- [ ] Dialogs use professional structure with cap bar, gradient header, and `bg-slate-50` content
- [ ] Custom colors use opacity syntax: `bg-blue/10` (NOT `bg-blue-100`)
- [ ] Icons use brand color: `text-[#0f5384]` for headers
- [ ] Buttons use: `primary-btn px-3 sm:px-4`
- [ ] All interactive elements have transition effects
- [ ] Text inputs, selects, textareas, and search fields use `border-[0.25px] border-slate-300` (never 1px `border`, white, transparent, or `slate-200` on light fills)
- [ ] 3-dot overflow menus use `/assets/icons/dots.svg` (34×34) with `shad-no-focus rounded-full hover:bg-white/30` — not Lucide `MoreVertical`
- [ ] Delete / Archive menu items have `<DropdownMenuSeparator />` immediately above them and `tone="danger"`
- [ ] Badges use `inline-block px-2 py-0.5 text-xs rounded-full font-medium border` plus CAALM status colors (`bg-green/10`, `bg-orange/10`, `bg-red/10`, `bg-blue/10`, or slate) — not default shadcn Badge variants

